<!--
Inspired by Rainbow CSV

Language name     | Separator     | Extension | Properties
 TSV              | \t (TAB)      | .tsv .tab |
 CSV (comma)      | , (comma)     |   .csv    | Ignored inside double-quoted fields
 CSV (semicolon)  | ; (semicolon) |   .csv    | Ignored inside double-quoted fields
 CSV (whitespace) | whitespace    |   .csv    | Consecutive whitespaces are merged
 CSV (pipe)       | | (pipe)      |   .csv    |

https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4180

Although the RFC considers this invalid,
the syntax is tolerant of spaces before double quotes.

  aaa, "bbb,ccc", ddd
       ~ RFC: invalid character in non-escaped rule
-->
